flowchart LR
  User[User in Chrome]
  Page[Open Google Sheet / Doc / Slide]
  Ext[SheetSpeed extension]
  Local[Chrome local storage]
  Sync[Chrome sync if the user enables it]
  GAPI[Google Sheets / Slides / Drive APIs]
  Drive[Temporary PNG in the user's Drive]
  CWS[Chrome Web Store]
  CF[Cloudflare]
  Site[GitHub Pages website]
  Fonts[Google Fonts]
  Mail[Google Workspace mailbox]
  EP[ExtensionPay - when billing opens]
  Stripe[Stripe - when billing opens]

  User --> Ext
  Ext --> Page
  Ext --> Local
  Ext -.-> Sync
  Ext -->|Pro after consent| GAPI
  GAPI -.-> Drive
  User --> CWS
  User --> CF --> Site
  CF --> Fonts
  User -->|support email| Mail
  Ext -.->|not during early access| EP --> Stripe
